sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor traveler as Traveler
  participant orch as Travel orchestrator<br/>MCP Sidecar OBO processor
  participant idp as IBM Verify
  participant booking as Booking agent<br/>MCP Sidecar OBO processor
  participant mcp as Flight search<br/>MCP server

  traveler->>orch: Sign in, then send the trip request with the user token
  orch->>idp: Token exchange for the booking agent audience,<br/>signed client assertion (private_key_jwt)
  idp-->>orch: Token for booking agent
  orch->>booking: Call over mTLS with the token for booking agent
  booking->>booking: Verify the token before policy uses its claims
  booking->>idp: Token exchange for the MCP server audience
  idp-->>booking: Token for MCP server
  booking->>mcp: Call over mTLS with the token for MCP server
  mcp->>mcp: Verify the token
